event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nI hear how completely draining"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" this has been, and your well-being must come first. However, before you hand in that notice tomorrow, let's pause and"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" assess the variables. Do you have an emergency reserve to cover three to six months of living expenses, or could you take"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a medical or mental health leave to create immediate breathing room? Let’s get dinner tonight and draft a concrete, orderly exit strategy"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" before you make a sudden break.\n\n## 2\n\nEven if we temporarily set aside every satellite photograph ever produced, the empirical record demonstrating"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the Earth's curvature predates modern space travel by thousands of years. Around 240 BCE, Eratosthenes calculated the Earth"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"'s circumference to remarkable accuracy simply by measuring the varying angles of shadows cast by identical sticks in Syene and Alexandria on the summer"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" solstice. Furthermore, during every lunar eclipse, the shadow cast by the Earth onto the Moon is an arc of a circle—a geometry mathematically"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" impossible for a flat disk tilted at varying angles to reproduce consistently. The physical evidence across celestial mechanics, navigation, and geometry"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" cross-references seamlessly: the Earth is an oblate spheroid.\n\n## 3\n\nSunlight appears white to our"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" eyes, but it is actually a composite of all the colors of the rainbow combined. Light travels in waves, and each"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" color has a different wavelength: red and orange light travel in long, lazy waves, while blue and violet light travel in very"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" short, choppy waves. \n\nWhen sunlight reaches Earth, it enters our atmosphere, which is packed with billions of tiny gas molecules,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" mostly nitrogen and oxygen. Because blue light travels in short wavelengths, it collides with these tiny molecules and bounces off in every"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" direction far more often than the longer wavelengths do. This physical phenomenon is called Rayleigh scattering. When you stand on the ground and look up during"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the day, your eyes are simply registering this scattered blue light bouncing all around the sky.\n\n## 4\n\n夜幕低"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"垂，窗外落雨如注。密集的水珠接连撞击着玻璃窗，顺着明净"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"的纹路汇成细流，蜿蜒而下。街道上的路灯在潮湿的柏油路面上晕"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"开一圈圈昏黄而柔和的光斑。空气中弥漫着泥土与青草被浸"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"润后的清冽气息，远处的车流声被雨声滤得格外沉闷。室内一灯如"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"豆，唯有书页翻动的微响与檐下的滴答声相和，整座城市仿佛都在"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"这层层雨幕中沉沉睡去。\n\n## 5\n\nSubject: Re: Team Drinks this Friday\n\nHi Julian"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":",\n\nThank you for organizing the team drinks and for the invitation. \n\nRegrettably, I have a prior commitment scheduled"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" for Friday evening and will not be able to attend. I hope you all have an enjoyable evening, and I look forward to catching up with everyone"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" on Monday.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Name]\n\n## 6\n\nMy writing style is structured, exact, and deliberately cataloged"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", prioritizing clarity, proportion, and factual precision over unnecessary ornamentation."}}

